### ✨ Core Features
- **Modern RESTful API**: Built with Node.js and Express, following standard REST conventions with centralized error handling and health monitoring.
- **Relational Data Modeling**: Structured with MongoDB & Mongoose schemas enforcing field validations, type constraints, unique indexes, and foreign key references.
