## 📡 REST API Reference

Base URL: `http://localhost:{{app.port}}/api`

### Health Check
- `GET /api/health` - Checks database connection state and uptime.

{{#if app.auth}}
### Authentication Endpoints
- `POST /api/auth/register` - Register a new account (`name`, `email`, `password`)
- `POST /api/auth/login` - Authenticate and retrieve a JWT bearer token
- `GET /api/auth/me` - Retrieve current logged-in user profile (requires `Authorization: Bearer <token>`)
{{/if}}

